,"value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-31T18:33:27-08:00","id":1501838,"title":"","content":"Some things updated via the end-of-month Release Roundup. So noted that in the OP.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1501813#post1501813\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm more than a little confused/concerned on the At8D update. The last update was &quot;Awaiting art-notes&quot; and now it's &quot;With Maria for ADing.&quot;<br /> So is the art in and getting sorted? Or is Maria just now getting art notes 13+ months later?</div> </div> </div> </div>This is probably best asked in the comments of the Monday Metting update.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-06T18:40:36-08:00","id":1502336,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1501838#post1501838\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Some things updated via the end-of-month Release Roundup. So noted that in the OP.<br /> This is probably best asked in the comments of the Monday Metting update.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh I have on a number of occasions. That said, &quot;<b>Ex3 Eight Directions </b>\u2013 Contracting,&quot; would seem to answer that question.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-07T00:01:29-08:00","id":1502350,"title":"","content":"Updated as per latest Monday Meeting notes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-12T21:36:24-08:00","id":1502912,"title":"","content":"I wonder what the rough eta for ExEss is... 2 weeks? 4weeks? 6 weeks? If I wanted to get into a solo game with a novice player online, would I be justified in asking. hey let's make mortal heroes in this game with a cool setting and roll play our Exaltations when the prologue is complete, and the book is out?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1411-wingnut2292","name":"wingnut2292","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1411_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-13T23:40:06-08:00","id":1503002,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wingnut2292</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1502912#post1502912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder what the rough eta for ExEss is... 2 weeks? 4weeks? 6 weeks? If I wanted to get into a solo game with a novice player online, would I be justified in asking. hey let's make mortal heroes in this game with a cool setting and roll play our Exaltations when the prologue is complete, and the book is out?</div> </div> </div> </div>As of this week's Monday Meeting it's going to Paradox for approvals, so... anything from 1 to 4 weeks before it's sent out to backers, based on prior record.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-21T10:07:48-08:00","id":1503624,"title":"","content":"So... weren't we supposed to be getting a sorcery book for 3e?<br /> <br /> I kind of checked out after the long delays and a strong aversion to 3e's mechanics but Essence brought me back in and so once again I care about the release schedule of 3e products.<br /> <br /> I vaguely recall that one of the first supplements for 3e was supposed to be a sorcery book for this edition - is that just dead in the water? Am I misremembering? Is there some other supplement coming that expands sorcery in this edition?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4942-gorgondynamo","name":"GorgonDynamo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4942_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-21T19:52:47-08:00","id":1503661,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GorgonDynamo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503624#post1503624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So... weren't we supposed to be getting a sorcery book for 3e?<br /> <br /> I kind of checked out after the long delays and a strong aversion to 3e's mechanics but Essence brought me back in and so once again I care about the release schedule of 3e products.<br /> <br /> I vaguely recall that one of the first supplements for 3e was supposed to be a sorcery book for this edition - is that just dead in the water? Am I misremembering? Is there some other supplement coming that expands sorcery in this edition?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>Paths of Brigid</i> was the pitched book, but basically when the developer change-over and re-ordering happened, things they had pitched ended up being backburnered and have to be re-applied. At this time the plan is to continue to include sorcerous (and necromantic) spells and initations in the splatbooks.<br /> <br /> The current in effect de-approved books were<br /> <i>Towers of the Mighty</i> (a book on manses, ruins, and ancient cities) which has been re-pitched at leas.<br /> <br /> <i>Different Skies</i>, which is defunct with the advent of <i>Across the 8 Directions</i>.<br /> <br /> <i>War in Heaven</i>, which we don't honestly know what was going to be its details but Sidereals and the expansion on Getimians supplants it too.<br /> <br /> There was also a title tossed aorund called <i>Crown and Sword</i>, which at this point is probably not on the docket, but mostly a &quot;how to actuall run countries book&quot; thing ala the WoD books <i>Gilded Cage</i> and <i>Midnight Siege</i>. Probalby not high on the priorty versus what's above and some other books proposed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-21T20:28:42-08:00","id":1503662,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503661#post1503661\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>Paths of Brigid</i> was the pitched book, but basically when the developer change-over and re-ordering happened, things they had pitched ended up being backburnered and have to be re-applied. At this time the plan is to continue to include sorcerous (and necromantic) spells and initations in the splatbooks.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well at least I know my memory is still somewhat intact as that's what I thought it was going to be called. A shame we didn't get it and may not get it. I'm still deeply saddened that we're this far into 3e and don't have a sorcery book or a 'Scavenger Lands' style setting book (yet).<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4942-gorgondynamo","name":"GorgonDynamo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4942_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-21T22:52:21-08:00","id":1503665,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GorgonDynamo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503662#post1503662\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well at least I know my memory is still somewhat intact as that's what I thought it was going to be called. A shame we didn't get it and may not get it. I'm still deeply saddened that we're this far into 3e and don't have a sorcery book or a 'Scavenger Lands' style setting book (yet).<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>With the three hardcovers so far, we actually haver a good range of sorcery. We'll likely just go that route. It's a bit why we don't need a <i>Scroll of the Monk</i>-style book this edition IMHO. Like...the Sidereal Companion has 13 styles in it on its own.<br /> <br /> While a sorcery book in general woudl be nice, I think that what was often in those is at this point kind of spread-out between Arms and the indivdual books, with most of what we're missing stuff like socieites, Brigid, history of sorcery broadly, and I guess a nice book of like, buncha misc stuff. I could see it coming back at somep oint, but not until after other things.<br /> <br /> <i>Across the 8 Directions</i> at least be coming, though. Last I saw it cocked in as big as <i>What Fire Has Wrough</i>t, so it is a biggy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-22T08:08:16-08:00","id":1503681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503665#post1503665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> With the three hardcovers so far, we actually haver a good range of sorcery. We'll likely just go that route. It's a bit why we don't need a <i>Scroll of the Monk</i>-style book this edition IMHO. Like...the Sidereal Companion has 13 styles in it on its own.<br /> <br /> While a sorcery book in general woudl be nice, I think that what was often in those is at this point kind of spread-out between Arms and the indivdual books, with most of what we're missing stuff like socieites, Brigid, history of sorcery broadly, and I guess a nice book of like, buncha misc stuff. I could see it coming back at somep oint, but not until after other things.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fair, I'd just rather it be compiled somewhere. It could've been wrapped it into a book with more on manses/hearthstones, various societies/history of sorcery, throw in more artifacts, possibly some new and more esoteric types of lesser magic (or give thaumaturgy a revamped treatment) and so on. I'd have imagined if it had come out when it was supposed to it'd also cover necromancy as a hold over until Abyssals or one of its companion books does so. Who knows, maybe at some point.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503665#post1503665\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Across the 8 Directions</i> at least be coming, though. Last I saw it cocked in as big as <i>What Fire Has Wrough</i>t, so it is a biggy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm really, really looking forward to At8D, and have been since it was announced forever ago. I'm hoping we get more info or a release date for it soon as it has a been a long time coming.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4942-gorgondynamo","name":"GorgonDynamo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4942_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-22T18:16:33-08:00","id":1503712,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GorgonDynamo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503681#post1503681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm really, really looking forward to At8D, and have been since it was announced forever ago. I'm hoping we get more info or a release date for it soon as it has a been a long time coming.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm really, REALLY hoping At8D picks up steam. It took over a year for it to move from &quot;assembling art notes&quot; to &quot;contracting art.&quot;<br /> Fun (In a &quot;don't make me laugh... bitterly&quot; sense) the time between the official At8D announcement and now is in fact longer than the gap between the conclusion of the 3rd Edition KS and it's proper release.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":882,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","user":"SamuraiMujuru","date":". 02-23-2023, 04:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-23T06:00:19-08:00","id":1503750,"title":"","content":"Yeah, At8D is the one that's making me frustrated too. I don't think the delay is unique so much as when the splatbooks suffer a delay at this stage we've got usable manuscripts from the Kickstarter to tide us over or it's something like Many Faced Strangers which would be nice to see soon but its absence isn't threatening to send me into decision paralysis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-23T13:47:32-08:00","id":1503772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lioness</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503750#post1503750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, At8D is the one that's making me frustrated too. I don't think the delay is unique so much as when the splatbooks suffer a delay at this stage we've got usable manuscripts from the Kickstarter to tide us over or it's something like Many Faced Strangers which would be nice to see soon but its absence isn't threatening to send me into decision paralysis.</div> </div> </div> </div>I would pay full price for At8D right this instant if it got me the completed manuscript while we wait for art and layout. There's soooo many places on the map that get maybe two sentences in any other book currently out that I desperately want to know more about and all the little tidbits we've been getting about the overhauled existing locations sounds spectacular that it's absolutely maddening that it's been nearly five years in the making. What the hell is that dragon doing in Champoor? What the fuck is with the ice dorito? How have you given awesome places with dodgy execution the same glow-up that everything else has gotten?!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-24T05:32:58-08:00","id":1503801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1503772#post1503772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would pay full price for At8D right this instant if it got me the completed manuscript while we wait for art and layout.</div> </div> </div> </div>Same tbh. At least Essence's setting section has given some insight into what's going to be in there. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-25T12:12:26-08:00","id":1503909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gribblethemunchkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1500601#post1500601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Is it feasible to explain roughly how long the development process is from any of these stages? I'm not sure how wildly it might vary between products, nor how common slipage and rearranging of timetables is and whether this might be something that can't really be quantified.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've tried to do exactly that, in a historic sense, anyway. I'll link a spreadsheet below that tracks the dates that every Onyx Path product enters each stage, from the week be that At8D first entered the MMN list. It's a few weeks behind the current MMN event horizon at present, and I'm certainly not immune from error, but what's there has gone through multiple rounds of error checking by me. The cards products and Trinity Assassin's are the only ones where I know there's something weird going on my end for sure at this point.<br /> <br /> The &quot;Analysis&quot; tab will be what you're after. That gives average number of weeks in each development stage, both for all OPP products overall and various splits. These are by game line, IP owner, and product type (eg core rulebook, splatbook, bestiary, adventure, sourcebook etc). Some of those numbers may not totally add up, because Art Direction can run alongside other stages in some cases, and is used as a &quot;stop date&quot; for editing, so some truncation may happen if that's the case.<br /> <br /> Also worth noting that, because Art Direction and subsequent stages are notated slightly differently from prior stages, that I've often waited until release to trawl through those stages in detail. That means that Art Direction and beyond may not be as complete as they could be in some cases.<br /> <br /> With all that said, here's the link: <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1q8q1QeWLHpqzrmMPU5KDR0YNuEJlqsdARMlH8uXv-Dw/edit?usp=drivesdk\" target=\"_blank\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets...t?usp=drivesdk</a> <br /> I'm also absolutely gagging for At8D. The podcast I cohost is quite setting-dependent, and once we're through the Great Houses there'll only be a handful of places we can cover with full 3e detail before the book comes out.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://wondrousatlas.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">Wondrous Atlas of Creation's Destiny</a> - I cohost an Exalted podcast focusing on examining the setting's lore and how to develop them into elements to use in games.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/924488-homebuilt-exalted-st-screen-reference-sheet\" target=\"_blank\">Ex3 Reference Materials</a> - currently includes an ST screen, common actions sheet, weapons reference sheet, character creation summary and mortal QCs reference sheet.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/497-xerxes","name":"Xerxes","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar497_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-02-25T19:27:07-08:00","id":1503921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>gribblethemunchkin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1500601#post1500601\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have a single question. Is it feasible to explain roughly how long the development process is from any of these stages? I'm not sure how wildly it might vary between products, nor how common slipage and rearranging of timetables is and whether this might be something that can't really be quantified. In particular and for my own selfish reasons, I'm crazy excited to see the abyssal stuff and would love to know what kind of release date something in first draft might have. Is that a thing that can be speculated, even if its just a &quot;Mid 2025&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do not know how this things works with Exalted, but in other Onyx Path gamelines I watch, it's about 2 years from crowdfunding ( Kickstarter ) to finalised product. It's all predictions and weird things happen - but mostly it's correct, like 80% from what I see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T16:51:42-08:00","id":1504513,"title":"","content":"Thank you for these Blaque. Many do not appear in the latest MMN.<br /> <br /> Heroes of the Niobraran was another awesome idea. Have we heard anything about it after the change in Devs?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"left\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">She/Her. I am literal-minded and write literally. If I don't say something explicitly, please never assume I implied it. The only exception is if I try to make a joke.</span></span></span></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">My point of view may be different from yours but is equally valid.</span></span></span><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x1ycoxJF0G9niMt5D3Pp7owZ7tw8AJvL?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted-cWoD-ArM url mega-library</a>. Exalted <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/663334-random-name-generator\" target=\"_blank\">name-generators</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/896-erinys","name":"Erinys","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar896_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4235"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T23:49:09-08:00","id":1504544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1504513#post1504513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you for these Blaque. Many do not appear in the latest MMN.<br /> <br /> Heroes of the Niobraran was another awesome idea. Have we heard anything about it after the change in Devs?</div> </div> </div> </div>I suspect it's got the same status as <i>Different Skies</i> or <i>War on Heaven</i> and kind of kiboshed at this point in favor of other titles.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T23:51:51-08:00","id":1504545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Erinys</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1504513#post1504513\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you for these Blaque. Many do not appear in the latest MMN.</div> </div> </div> </div>They've changed how that works; the MMN are for whatever's changed that week, while the monthly release roundups will have the full list of where everything currently is in production. Blaque's updates give us the week-by-week update of the full list the MMN used to have.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-05T23:53:42-08:00","id":1504546,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1504544#post1504544\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I suspect it's got the same status as <i>Different Skies</i> or <i>War on Heaven</i> and kind of kiboshed at this point in favor of other titles.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think partly because a good part of it would've been historical setting; Vance and Minton want to focus on current Creation for the time being.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T00:15:11-08:00","id":1504549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>marin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1504546#post1504546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think partly because a good part of it would've been historical setting; Vance and Minton want to focus on current Creation for the time being.</div> </div> </div> </div>Pretty much, yeah. There's a want to go over things most broadly useful, and as you note, not as historical. Elements and references to the Niobraran show up here and there in the books, mainly in hisotry bits or in passing with an artifact's history. The most we'll likely get is there could be a section on them in <i>Crucible of Legends</i> I think where it talks about various factions of Creation, some relevant-to-today context with parts of the world in <i>Across the 8 Directions</i>, and we'll have at least NPC stats and how-to-use for Spoken in <i>Pillars of Creation</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-03-06T23:14:55-08:00","id":1504731,"title":"","content":"Updated to reflect latest Monday Meeting Notes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-04-17T19:04:24-07:00","id":1508703,"title":"","content":"Haven't updated the forum thread in a bit, so some updates, the big one being Abyssals moved to Development and MFS seems to be back in Art Direction for whatever reason.","signature":"