e":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-08T08:32:12-07:00","id":1520111,"title":"","content":"Crucible of Legend finally hits early release PDF tomorrow. Only took four years. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It absolutely boggles the mind that Exalted has &quot;the largest pool of dedicated developers for any single game line,&quot; but we're still over five years out from At8D's announcement and have no idea whatsoever when we'll actually see the bloody thing. Arguably one of the most important books in the entire line, but zero transparency on what on earth has been going on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-08T08:54:07-07:00","id":1520116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1520111#post1520111\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Crucible of Legend finally hits early release PDF tomorrow. Only took four years. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> It absolutely boggles the mind that Exalted has &quot;the largest pool of dedicated developers for any single game line,&quot; but we're still over five years out from At8D's announcement and have no idea whatsoever when we'll actually see the bloody thing. Arguably one of the most important books in the entire line, but zero transparency on what on earth has been going on.</div> </div> </div> </div>The last update was they had to recomission the maps. So it seems to be a case that happens often in the industry where a freelance artist drags things out and then they ahve to replace them after a few months of nothing. Two of those years included COVID (2020-2021) and its hellscape. The book is reportedly as big as <i>What Fire Has Wrought</i>. And we have had this status udpate thing.<br /> <br /> Note that in 2013, all we would have gotten was &quot;It's being done&quot; and that's it. A bit of the issue we see wiht things these days is we see the sausage being mad emore than before 3e, all told.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-08T10:02:18-07:00","id":1520132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blaque</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1500523-exalted-product-status?p=1520116#post1520116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The last update was they had to recomission the maps. So it seems to be a case that happens often in the industry where a freelance artist drags things out and then they ahve to replace them after a few months of nothing. Two of those years included COVID (2020-2021) and its hellscape. The book is reportedly as big as <i>What Fire Has Wrought</i>. And we have had this status udpate thing.<br /> <br /> Note that in 2013, all we would have gotten was &quot;It's being done&quot; and that's it. A bit of the issue we see wiht things these days is we see the sausage being mad emore than before 3e, all told.</div> </div> </div> </div>At8D &quot;entered&quot; art direction in November of 2021, but didn't even get handed off to Maria until just shy of February of this year. And sure, we've got more insight than we would in 2013, but when you're starting from 0 even 1 looks good. I follow and back plenty of other OPP lines and products that will actually discuss what is going on when wrenches hit the works, Realms of Pugmire and the OGL debacle, for example.<br /> <br /> Hell, Exalted Essence KS launched a third of the way through 2021 and I've got a print copy in hand. That's not to say Essence and such are taking away energy and effort from the rest of the line. It didn't. But what is it that's been holding up the earlier announcements like At8D, CoL, and MfS that hasn't been holding up Essence, Sidereals, Abyssals, etc? And what on earth is even going on with Getimians?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":882,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","user":"SamuraiMujuru","date":". 08-08-2023, 01:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-08T11:16:03-07:00","id":1520137,"title":"","content":"So far we have heard that at least in the case of At8D, just generlaly it's a big book, that takes a nearly as much time to dev as something more mechanical. Note that this edition, unlike witht he Compass books, there's an attempt by the devs to keep things consistent, clear, and diverse. This means a lot of cross-referencing, cross-checking, mkaing sure maps are right by folks who don't normally work in map-related fields (the main devs for Exalted are a lawyer and an editior as their day jobs). And it is, again, a book notably bigger than most sourcebooks.<br /> <br /> At least in At8D, my guess is that maps are the issue. It takes time to find a good fantasy cartographer, it takes time to hash thing sout, and it seems in this case, they had to start from scratch at some point? I dunno, but that's all I got on that.<br /> <br /> MFS seems to have had some hiccup with the art for the NPCs? That seems to be what's going on with current art notes and sketches. When it got to layout they needed more art, and so that's what kind of rolled it back. And art can take a bit form notes, to sketches, and all the iteration. This is something that folks underestimate I think the itme it takes.<br /> <br /> Can't say on CoL save that probably a lot of development and art notes got delayed. Dunno.<br /> <br /> On Getimians, it has straight-up not been announced. That's more or less where it's at until we hear further. Right now my guess is Alchemicals and Infernals are being prioritized over Getimians and Liminals. And that if the current backlog clears, we might see movement but there are other not-splat things folks wanna do. So we'll see on what they want to do and what Paradox lets them do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":353,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","user":"Blaque","date":". 08-21-2023, 10:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-08-21T19:14:51-07:00","id":1521159,"title":"","content":"Few things shifted up so updated.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-22T13:21:01-08:00","id":1525809,"title":"","content":"Some things moved up last Monday, so update.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"